OL,3,GNEWSAPrince William says UK faces
OL,4,Aterrifying risk of more wildfires due
OL,5,Ato climate change
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe also suggested the community's
OL,8,Fresponse to the incident was an example
OL,9,Ffor others to follow, after locals
OL,10,Frallied around to support those
OL,11,Ffighting the flames.
